 behaviour, ownership and independent ID counters.\n\nCover invalid arguments, impossible dates and unknown projects.\nVerify that failed commands leave data and ID counters unchanged.\n\nTest usage hints, corrected commands in the same session, and clean\nshutdown on exit or end-of-input.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":1029,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"576d0f6a9a6955929eee446d7c05b127fb9e18ed","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refactor application validation exceptions","messageBody":"Introduce a shared BusyNotFreeException hierarchy with command,\nproject, task and event exceptions.\n\nReplace generic validation exceptions so the CLI handles expected\napplication failures without hiding unrelated programming errors.\nPreserve error messages, usage hints and original exception causes.\n\nUpdate tests to verify exception types and continued CLI operation.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":212,"deletions":47},"test-code":{"insertions":170,"deletions":58}}},{"hash":"51b439fff79a1e43678a76bc6bc9e44b8b11b8b5","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix slash-containing argument values","messageBody":"Recognise only reserved argument prefixes so text such as UI/UX\nand src/main remains part of a name or description.\n\nPreserve missing, blank, repeated and inappropriate-prefix checks.\nDocument the reserved-prefix rule.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":10,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"3431c05995cf35bd37834ec3e94fadf7b3cf2470","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Expand test coverage for add commands","messageBody":"Add slash-parsing regression tests and edge-case coverage for\nproject.add, task.add and event.add.\n\nVerify argument orders, prefix validation, date boundaries and\nfree-text names. Check that failed additions preserve data and IDs,\nIDs remain unique beyond 999, and the CLI continues after errors.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":482,"deletio